{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is a solution to the differential equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3bf25968115cb47720cdf9bb30c0696a35fdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39;&#39; + 4y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b0b53e3eb1a02ae4aefe1f32aeb113bfa58094c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ y = e^{2x}  \\quad \\textbf{(B)}\\ y = 2\\sin x  \\quad \\textbf{(C)}\\ y = \\sin 2x  \\quad \\textbf{(D)}\\ y = 2\\cos x  \\quad \\textbf{(E)}\\ y = e^{-2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"608\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each answer choice, we calculate the second derivatives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc8b3f74bcf7c07fc0bb6e488182f87b42dc507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39;&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" /> to see if the answer matches the differential equation.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4a1598d6d4d46367d8c8a1714b9600f9677925f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import fontsize;  size(13cm); defaultpen(fontsize(10pt));  string[][] data = { \t{&quot;$y$&quot;, &quot;$y&#39;$&quot;, &quot;$y&#39;&#39;$&quot;, &quot;$y&#39;&#39;+4y$&quot;}, \t{&quot;$e^{2x}$&quot;, &quot;$2e^{2x}$&quot;, &quot;$4e^{2x}$&quot;, &quot;$4e^{2x}+4e^{2x}=8e^{2x}$&quot;}, \t{&quot;$2\\sin x$&quot;, &quot;$2\\cos x$&quot;, &quot;$-2\\sin x$&quot;, &quot;$-2\\sin x+8\\sin x=6\\sin x$&quot;}, \t{&quot;$\\sin 2x$&quot;, &quot;$2\\cos 2x$&quot;, &quot;$-4\\sin 2x$&quot;, &quot;$-4\\sin 2x+4\\sin 2x=0$&quot;}, \t{&quot;$2\\cos x$&quot;, &quot;$-2\\sin x$&quot;, &quot;$-2\\cos x$&quot;, &quot;$-2\\cos x+8\\cos x=6\\cos x$&quot;}, \t{&quot;$e^{-2x}$&quot;, &quot;$-2e^{-2x}$&quot;, &quot;$4e^{-2x}$&quot;, &quot;$4e^{-2x}+4e^{-2x}=8e^{-2x}$&quot;} };  real[] cw = {1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 3.2};   // column widths real rh = 0.65;                     // row height (adjust to taste)  real[] xb = {0}; for(int j = 0; j &lt; cw.length; ++j) xb.push(xb[j] + cw[j]);  int R = data.length; int C = data[0].length;  pen grid = black + linewidth(0.8);  // Horizontal lines for(int i = 1; i &lt;= R - 1; ++i) draw((0, -i*rh)--(xb[C], -i*rh), grid);  // Vertical lines for(int j = 1; j &lt;= C - 1; ++j) draw((xb[j], 0)--(xb[j], -R*rh), grid);  // Cell contents for(int i = 0; i &lt; R; ++i) for(int j = 0; j &lt; C; ++j) label(data[i][j], ((xb[j] + xb[j+1])/2, -(i + 0.5)*rh), align=Center); [/asy]\" width=\"615\" height=\"325\" />\nOf the answer choices, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d3f971c1461e7c64dfac846678ab05b580eaa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ y = \\sin 2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"126\" height=\"30\" /> matches the given differential equation.\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a h